WEBVTT

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Zero kara kakedashite

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Start running from
the beginning,

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
Omoi dake
wo dakishimete

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
with nothing but your emotions
in your hands.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Sonomama kakenukete

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Just keep running...

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
Itsumo koko
de mitsumeteru

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
I'm always watching
you from here.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
Hajimete deatta hi no
manazashi wasurenai

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
I still remember your expression
the day we first met.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
Taiyou mitai ni kokoro
wo terashitekureta

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
It lit up my heart like the sun.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
Asu no yukue sagashite
nayandeiru nara

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
If you're anxious about
where to go tomorrow,

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
Ima kimi no tame
ni akari ni naritai yo

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
I want to become
a beacon to you.

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Zero kara tobidatte

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Start flying from
the beginning.

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Ima no kimi
wo toki hanachi

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Let go of your current self...

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
and fly towards infinity.

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
Mugen ni habataite

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
I will always watch over you...

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
Donna toki
mo mimaru yo

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
no matter how far you fly.

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
Kitto zutto tooku made

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:36.080
Episode 45 - Stars of the City

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:45.080
It's been thirty years since Chigusa Tsukikage
disappeared from the public eye.

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:47.210
We've finally arrived.

00:01:47.210 --> 00:01:49.000
It's been a long time.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:50.870
It has, Father.

00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:55.760
The two contenders for the lead role
will leave the so-called Town of the Plums,
the home of the Scarlet Angel,

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:59.860
as soon as the director and supporting
cast have been chosen.

00:01:59.860 --> 00:02:05.080
Has this all been arranged by the
National Acting Association...

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:08.240
or was that your suggestion?

00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:10.060
Hm... I wonder.

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:15.580
You've gotten better at
playing dumb, Masumi.

00:02:15.970 --> 00:02:20.420
Well, I'll just have to see
what you come up with.

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:27.740
Haven't you noticed that you've completely changed
the path of fate, all for the sake of
<i>The Scarlet Angel</i>?

00:02:27.740 --> 00:02:29.720
And that I'm about
to do the same?

00:02:33.030 --> 00:02:36.710
I'm afraid Mr. Masumi
has just stepped out.

00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:40.730
I only came to drop off these flowers.
I apologize for not doing more.

00:02:40.730 --> 00:02:43.200
They were blooming so beautifully in the greenhouse...

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:50.420
Would you care to look at Mr. Masumi's photo
albums while you're awaiting his return?

00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:52.600
Oh, thank you!

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:56.220
He looks so cute!

00:03:05.060 --> 00:03:07.780
There isn't a single picture
where he's laughing.

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:14.460
He looks so stern! But
why? Why is that?

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:24.230
Ever since I became Eisuke Hayami's son at the age
of six, I haven't once felt the warm touch of happiness.

00:03:25.610 --> 00:03:32.680
My father died when I was two. After
that, my mother raised me alone.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:36.510
I'm part of the new
live-in staff.

00:03:36.510 --> 00:03:39.400
My name is Aya Fujimura. It's
a pleasure to meet you.

00:03:39.640 --> 00:03:42.700
Don't bring that child into the
main wing of the house.

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:46.520
And the room in the
back is off-limits.

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:51.970
The master ran away from his home in Okayama
at the age of fourteen to come to Tokyo.

00:03:51.970 --> 00:03:56.480
He's worked very hard and now,
he owns several companies.

00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:58.850
Daito Entertainment is just one of the
many corporations he has a hand in.

00:03:58.850 --> 00:04:00.630
What's Daito Entertainment?

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:03.340
It's a company that produces
plays and movies.

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:10.880
One day, even though my mother had forbade
me, I was playing in the main wing.

00:04:34.730 --> 00:04:37.420
I told you never to
come in here!

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:40.760
I'm sorry! The door was open
and when I looked in,

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:43.730
I saw these pictures of
this beautiful woman...

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:48.590
So, even you have been bewitched
by the Scarlet Angel.

00:04:49.190 --> 00:04:51.080
Who's that?

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:53.560
She was played by Chigusa
Tsukikage.

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:55.530
She put on a spectacular
performance,

00:04:55.530 --> 00:05:00.960
but then, she was injured by a falling stage light and
has since disappeared off the face of the earth.

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:03.940
When I look at this robe
and these props,

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:08.680
it's like I can hear the faint breath
of the Scarlet Angel once more.

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:12.100
Get out! Never come
in here again!

00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:17.360
The Scarlet Angel...

00:05:18.820 --> 00:05:21.490
Eisuke's half-siblings
began to scheme...

00:05:21.490 --> 00:05:25.800
They made plans to make Eisuke adopt
their children so that they'd become...

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:27.670
heirs to his fortune.

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:33.330
Eisuke! These children say they want to be an
asset to Daito Entertainment in the future.

00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:35.590
I'll do anything for you, Uncle.

00:05:36.260 --> 00:05:38.010
Oh, is that so?

00:05:38.210 --> 00:05:43.320
If you kids can clean out all the mud from
this pond, then we'll talk about adoption.

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:44.950
What?!

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:48.590
You can't ask small kids to
do something like that!

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:50.670
Make sure you don't hurt the carp!

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:54.580
I don't want to do
this anymore!

00:05:55.860 --> 00:05:59.570
This is all your fault! You're the one
who said you'd do anything!

00:05:59.570 --> 00:06:02.050
Only 'cause Dad told me to!

00:06:05.060 --> 00:06:08.420
I don't think they're particularly
suited to be my successors.

00:06:08.420 --> 00:06:11.610
What are you talking about?! Any child
would have the same reaction!

00:06:11.610 --> 00:06:13.350
Hey, boy!

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:25.400
Now, we just need to put the water
back in again and we're all done.

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:29.120
Why did you ask the gardener
to help you, boy?

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:33.070
Because I knew I wouldn't be able to do it by
myself, and the gardener's always saying...

00:06:33.070 --> 00:06:36.300
the mud from this pond would
make good fertilizer.

00:06:36.300 --> 00:06:39.900
This way, the pond is now
clean, and he's happy too.

00:06:39.900 --> 00:06:46.530
So, you managed to satisfy both parties
involved without getting dirty yourself.

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:52.390
We did it!

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:58.800
The results of the investigation
show a flawless character.

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:05.580
A childhood illness prevented
Eisuke from having children.

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:09.500
Because he wanted to fashion a successor in
his own image, he decided to investigate me.

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:13.500
That's how I became
Masumi Hayami.

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:16.490
You could say that my mother
married him for my sake.

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:22.730
On my father's orders, I quit baseball and
started the life I would lead from then on.

00:07:23.780 --> 00:07:27.990
After school, I was forced to do the
cleaning at my father's company.

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:31.290
I wasn't allowed to speak
to my father at work,

00:07:31.290 --> 00:07:33.890
and the employees all thought
I was the janitor's son.

00:07:36.860 --> 00:07:39.050
Masumi, I bought this
for you on my trip.

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:41.090
For me?

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:46.880
The day our relatives came to stay was also
the first day he'd ever given me a present.

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:50.100
Thank you, Father!

00:07:54.520 --> 00:07:56.720
So, how did you weasel your
way close to Uncle?

00:07:58.600 --> 00:08:04.030
Our parents told us your mother only
married Uncle for his money.

00:08:04.030 --> 00:08:05.150
What?

00:08:05.930 --> 00:08:06.930
Stop it!

00:08:06.930 --> 00:08:08.300
Knock it off!

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:09.580
Masumi!

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:12.620
I'm terribly sorry!

00:08:12.620 --> 00:08:13.840
Please forgive him!

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:19.700
Why? Why did you
apologize?!

00:08:20.120 --> 00:08:22.160
They were the ones
who were wrong!

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:29.480
Dad got this for me. It's the first thing
he's ever bought me and now...

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:35.350
Do you understand, Masumi?
This is the power of envy.

00:08:35.350 --> 00:08:41.060
No matter how many aces life deals you,
you must keep them up your sleeve.

00:08:41.060 --> 00:08:44.940
That's the best way of not
making invisible enemies.

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:50.160
So, he purposefully gave me that present in front
of everyone else so that I could learn this lesson.

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:54.250
And then, a year later...

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:58.440
I would like to introduce
you all to my son.

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:04.930
My name is Masumi Hayami.
I'm pleased to meet you.

00:09:05.300 --> 00:09:07.920
The employees' attitudes towards me
changed in the blink of an eye.

00:09:07.920 --> 00:09:12.820
The very next day, scholars, experts and executives
queued up to tutor me in a number of subjects...

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:17.130
and in all manner of things concerning
Daito Entertainment.

00:09:17.130 --> 00:09:19.300
From politicians to financiers, I was
given plenty of opportunities...

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:24.330
to observe how my father conducted business
and how he worked with other people.

00:09:24.890 --> 00:09:26.520
Listen to me, Masumi.

00:09:26.520 --> 00:09:29.150
Everyone has a heads
and a tails.

00:09:29.150 --> 00:09:31.470
Those who stand at the top of
the pile can't afford to judge...

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:35.600
everyone around them based
on their heads face alone.

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:39.560
Those who stand on the cusp need to
know what it looks like below them.

00:09:39.560 --> 00:09:43.220
Otherwise, if a fire breaks out, or an
earthquake hits, they won't know...

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:44.970
how to escape.

00:09:44.970 --> 00:09:50.390
If you know the view from the summit, you might even
take the wrong path down and fall off your perch.

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:55.260
Eisuke Hayami was less like a father,
and more like a commander,
standing at the head of a phalanx of servants.

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:56.900
He was the company's
supreme authority.

00:09:57.660 --> 00:10:00.290
My mother tricked Father
into marrying her?

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:03.390
Stop spouting nonsense!
Apologize to my mother!

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:04.880
Masumi!

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:07.390
Masumi!

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:16.660
I'm not going back
to that place!

00:10:30.870 --> 00:10:33.330
Planetarium

00:10:42.170 --> 00:10:45.590
When I sat and watched the expanse of space
and the stars stretching out to infinity,

00:10:45.590 --> 00:10:48.970
I realized how insignificant
my own existence was.

00:10:49.520 --> 00:10:54.130
I watched the stars circling endlessly
round my head for hours that day.

00:11:00.460 --> 00:11:06.260
From that day onwards, the planetarium became
my only place of solace in my childhood.

00:11:09.150 --> 00:11:13.050
It is my dream to produce
<i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:11:13.350 --> 00:11:19.310
<i>The Scarlet Angel</i> first appeared to me
in my youth, when I was working like a demon.

00:11:19.630 --> 00:11:22.750
I had never been so moved
by anything in my whole life.

00:11:23.590 --> 00:11:27.350
I kept going back to that theater. When I heard
about another performance in a new venue,

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:29.010
I'd go there too, no matter
how far away it was.

00:11:29.010 --> 00:11:31.310
I wanted to maintain some
connection with it.

00:11:31.910 --> 00:11:35.290
That was the reason I created
Daito Entertainment.

00:11:36.270 --> 00:11:39.640
I'd like to revive <i>The Scarlet Angel</i> one more
time. If only I could find the whereabouts...

00:11:39.640 --> 00:11:42.670
of Chigusa Tsukikage!

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:46.340
Someone who refused to bend to
his will, no matter what he offered.

00:11:46.340 --> 00:11:50.320
My father was in love with an illusion
he longed for, but could never have.

00:11:51.180 --> 00:11:56.790
And then, I'll never forget that incident,
nor the harsh chill of the sea.

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:02.740
If you bring the money, we'll return
your son to you unharmed.

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:07.910
You must have called the wrong
number. I have no son.

00:12:08.320 --> 00:12:11.750
Help me! They're going
to kill me! Help me!

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:15.100
Father, help me! Father!

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:19.930
I had been abandoned.

00:12:19.930 --> 00:12:21.980
Hey, what did he say?!

00:12:24.270 --> 00:12:27.060
He said he'd bring your money
to the rendezvous point.

00:12:27.060 --> 00:12:30.720
I see! His kid's voice softened
him right up!

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:34.720
I knew I couldn't let them
know the truth.

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:39.430
If I did, they'd have killed me.

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:38.010
Hey!

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:44.670
You little bastard!

00:12:57.290 --> 00:13:00.500
They say I was saved
by a patrol boat.

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:03.090
Father, help!

00:13:03.090 --> 00:13:06.360
That phone was like a lifeline.

00:13:06.770 --> 00:13:10.670
When it cut off, my
heart went with it.

00:13:10.670 --> 00:13:14.630
The person I was yesterday
died in that sea.

00:13:17.720 --> 00:13:21.040
When I was in the second year
of junior high, there was a fire.

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:25.260
The Scarlet Angel! Where's
my Scarlet Angel?!

00:13:25.680 --> 00:13:28.000
Why didn't you bring her
things out with you?

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:30.080
I'm sorry!

00:13:32.570 --> 00:13:34.230
Mother...

00:13:35.770 --> 00:13:36.920
Mother!

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:39.300
Hey you, wait! Wait!

00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:39.290
Mother!

00:13:46.610 --> 00:13:47.950
Mother!

00:13:48.670 --> 00:13:51.190
Masumi! Thank God!

00:13:51.190 --> 00:13:55.200
The overcoat is still
fine. It's still fine...

00:13:55.860 --> 00:13:57.340
Mother?

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:06.290
That was the last time I
saw the Scarlet Angel.

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:10.910
My father became downcast.

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:14.000
Who knows... maybe he loved
my mother, after all.

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:18.440
Masumi, if you're willing to put in the
effort and meet my expectations,

00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:22.310
then I will consider making
you my successor.

00:14:22.310 --> 00:14:24.100
It's all up to you and the amount
of effort you put in.

00:14:24.100 --> 00:14:26.950
As if I'd stand next to
this man.

00:14:27.370 --> 00:14:29.600
Father, I...

00:14:30.740 --> 00:14:32.500
That burn.

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:35.680
That was made when my mother
pulled it from the fire.

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:37.390
The Scarlet Angel!

00:14:37.900 --> 00:14:39.880
I'm not going anywhere.

00:14:40.270 --> 00:14:44.220
I'll stay right here and study
by your side, Father.

00:14:44.220 --> 00:14:48.720
I will give my best so that I
can one day fill your shoes.

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:50.320
You've spoken well, my boy!

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:51.990
Your mother would have been very
happy to hear you say that too.

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:56.720
I'll meet your expectations and then
I'll take everything away from you...

00:14:56.720 --> 00:15:00.620
<i>The Scarlet Angel</i> and
everything you've built!

00:15:00.660 --> 00:15:04.620
Daito Entertainment

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:04.640
It was from that point on that I really
threw myself into my work.

00:15:04.640 --> 00:15:08.360
All I could think about was
how to excel at my job.

00:15:08.360 --> 00:15:11.470
I believed that success itself
equated to justice.

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:14.720
But since meeting that girl,

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:18.180
Maya Kitajima...

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:22.380
When you were on stage, you
were overflowing with passion.

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:27.970
Have I ever felt so strongly about
anything in my life until now?

00:15:29.260 --> 00:15:35.090
All I can do is to be your secret
admirer and watch you grow.

00:15:35.470 --> 00:15:39.540
Why? Why won't you agree to
the engagement right now?

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:42.000
Do you have some objection to the Takamiya family?

00:15:42.360 --> 00:15:45.740
No, but I'd like to delay it until we've finally managed
to put on <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:15:46.010 --> 00:15:49.400
I see. I guess putting on <i>The
Scarlet Angel</i>...

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:54.400
is something you've been working on for
my sake, ever since I became an invalid.

00:15:54.400 --> 00:15:59.380
I've been looking for Chigusa for a
long time with this wreck of a body.

00:16:00.050 --> 00:16:04.810
Even when I found her, she hid herself away again
as soon as she got wind of my presence.

00:16:05.680 --> 00:16:11.850
But then, ten years ago, I randomly saw Chigusa
when I was up north on business.

00:16:12.720 --> 00:16:14.800
Follow that car!

00:16:17.320 --> 00:16:20.180
Faster! Go faster!

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:29.960
It's fate that father and son would become
so immersed by <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:34.980
Your life would be very different if
you'd never met the Scarlet Angel.

00:16:36.020 --> 00:16:38.630
Who can tell? But yes,
you're probably right.

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:41.760
The same goes for
you, Masumi.

00:16:41.760 --> 00:16:43.840
You're right, Father.

00:16:44.990 --> 00:16:49.730
There's only one connection between us,
and that's <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:16:55.510 --> 00:16:57.020
I don't want to lose.

00:16:57.020 --> 00:17:00.150
I don't want to lose
to Maya Kitajima!

00:17:03.760 --> 00:17:06.550
Good evening, miss!

00:17:08.850 --> 00:17:10.460
You want to photograph me?

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:13.470
You're most kind, Mr. Hamille.

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:18.810
But seeing as you seem to think
I'm at my most beauteous when I'm in rehearsals,
dripping with sweat,

00:17:18.810 --> 00:17:21.390
why don't you take a
picture of me then?

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:24.950
You shouldn't let this opportunity
go to waste, Ayumi.

00:17:24.950 --> 00:17:28.440
Peter Hamille is a world-renowned
photographer!

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:31.610
I can't stand doing nothing
but smiling!

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:34.170
I'm a human being! I have my own will!

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:37.990
Ever since I was little, I've been living
in the shadow of my parents,

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:40.940
and no-one ever acknowledged
me as my own person.

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:44.260
I'm envious of Maya Kitajima.

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:49.230
Whenever she does something, people
acknowledge her own strength.

00:17:49.230 --> 00:17:54.240
She uses her own two hands to open doors one
after another and she gradually improves!

00:17:54.240 --> 00:17:55.270
Ayumi.

00:17:55.850 --> 00:18:02.980
You know that she's a genius,
don't you, Mom?

00:18:03.830 --> 00:18:05.020
I do.

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:08.180
The fragile glass mask
that breaks so easily...

00:18:08.180 --> 00:18:11.010
I'm the one who wears
it on stage.

00:18:11.810 --> 00:18:12.880
Ayumi...

00:18:12.880 --> 00:18:19.770
When the fruits of my tireless efforts have bested
the natural talent that she was born with,

00:18:19.770 --> 00:18:23.830
that's when I'll be able to
proudly live my own life!

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:25.410
I want to play the
Scarlet Angel!

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:27.640
I want to defeat
Maya Kitajima!

00:18:30.550 --> 00:18:34.760
<i>The Scarlet Angel.</i>
I'm finally here.

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:35.900
But...

00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:39.930
I still can't believe that heartless oaf
who'd sooner sell his grandmother...

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:42.170
than show compassion could possibly
be Mr. Purple Roses.

00:18:42.170 --> 00:18:45.140
No, that's just ridiculous!

00:18:46.070 --> 00:18:50.140
The sky is so full of stars,

00:18:50.140 --> 00:18:54.600
but you can't see them properly because of the
pollution and the light emanating from the Earth.

00:18:56.290 --> 00:18:59.610
There are going to be two directors
for <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>?

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:00.690
Yes.

00:19:00.690 --> 00:19:03.360
Hajime Onodera, who
we recommended,

00:19:04.320 --> 00:19:09.710
and Ryuuzo Kuronuma, who won the Best Director
Award for <i>The Forgotten Wilderness</i>.

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:13.710
These two are judges
for the second round.

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:17.750
There's also a system in place where all roles
other than the main ones will require auditions.

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:22.820
The steps the National Acting Association
is taking are the same as the ones
outlined in Daito Entertainment's plan.

00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:24.960
What a remarkable coincidence.

00:19:25.630 --> 00:19:26.800
Isn't it?

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:31.330
The Scarlet Angel
Audition
Round Two

00:19:41.940 --> 00:19:44.720
I'm counting on you,
Mr. Chairman.

00:19:44.720 --> 00:19:46.260
After the second round
of auditions,

00:19:46.260 --> 00:19:49.150
the famous veteran male
actor, Kei Akame;

00:19:49.150 --> 00:19:52.240
the son of acting nobility,
Masaharu Ichimura;

00:19:52.240 --> 00:19:55.430
Fusao Momoki, from a
popular police drama;

00:19:55.430 --> 00:19:57.710
and various other high profile actors
have successfully made it through.

00:19:57.710 --> 00:20:02.210
Yuu Sakurakouji
is among them.

00:20:02.890 --> 00:20:06.520
Everyone who has made it through
this round of auditions, please report
to the office in three days' time.

00:20:06.520 --> 00:20:10.470
There will be an important announcement
regarding the third round.

00:20:14.970 --> 00:20:18.120
Please forgive me for driving
you to your death.

00:20:18.120 --> 00:20:19.790
Haru Kitajima,

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:24.440
I know there's nothing I will ever be
able to do to earn your forgiveness,

00:20:24.440 --> 00:20:28.580
but I shall protect that girl for as long
as I live, as a purple shadow.

00:20:36.610 --> 00:20:38.050
Purple roses!

00:20:40.530 --> 00:20:44.380
He came on the anniversary
of her death...

00:20:47.860 --> 00:20:52.910
Do these belong to Mr. Purple
Roses? But that means...

00:20:55.700 --> 00:20:57.600
I'm sorry,

00:20:57.600 --> 00:21:00.750
but Mr. Hayami is out on business at the moment. He's
gone to a test shoot for a movie at the Daito Studio.

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:10.900
That was simply spectacular!

00:21:10.900 --> 00:21:14.620
Most impressive, Mr. Hayami.

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:16.020
Mr. Hayami.

00:21:17.940 --> 00:21:22.120
Excuse me. That man
dropped this.

00:21:22.120 --> 00:21:23.610
Thank you.

00:21:25.730 --> 00:21:27.990
It was marvelous!

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:28.000
President Hayami.

00:21:28.000 --> 00:21:30.200
It seems you dropped this.

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:32.110
Oh, thank you.

00:21:34.710 --> 00:21:36.130
He took it!

00:21:36.130 --> 00:21:37.880
He took the lighter!

00:21:38.680 --> 00:21:40.310
It really was you!

00:21:40.310 --> 00:21:41.870
You were Mr. Purple
Roses all along!

00:21:42.180 --> 00:21:45.870
But that's too cruel!

00:21:45.870 --> 00:21:47.140
Why?!

00:21:47.140 --> 00:21:49.830
Why, Mr. Hayami?!

00:21:51.650 --> 00:21:56.680
Hello hello

00:21:51.650 --> 00:21:56.680
Hello, hello.

00:22:04.150 --> 00:22:15.280
Fukanou dato iwarenagara
tobitatte

00:22:04.150 --> 00:22:15.280
Even though they say it's
impossible, I fly off.

00:22:15.280 --> 00:22:25.160
Kanaeta yume mo koboreochita
yume mo aru

00:22:15.280 --> 00:22:25.160
There are dreams that come true,
and dreams that crumble away.

00:22:25.160 --> 00:22:36.830
Soredemo isshoukenmei ikiru
kazu dake hoshi ga fueru

00:22:25.160 --> 00:22:36.830
But even then, for every person trying hard
to live their life, a new star is born.

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:49.240
Kyou mo mata hitotsu
umareru hoshi miagete

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:49.240
Today, I look up again, at
another newly born star.

00:22:49.240 --> 00:22:50.570
And I say,

00:22:49.240 --> 00:22:50.570
And I say,

00:22:50.570 --> 00:22:53.890
Hello hello another star

00:22:50.570 --> 00:22:53.890
Hello, hello another star.

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:57.030
If I wish anything
will change

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:57.030
If I wish anything will change.

00:22:57.030 --> 00:23:02.770
Ai wo daite norikonda
shatoru

00:22:57.030 --> 00:23:02.770
I've boarded the shuttle
with my love.

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:09.120
Daremo ga hitori no
uchuuhikoushi dayo

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:09.120
Every single person
is an astronaut.

00:23:09.120 --> 00:23:14.190
Negau yume
kara yume e

00:23:09.120 --> 00:23:14.190
From fulfilled dream to dream,

00:23:14.190 --> 00:23:21.470
Dokomademo
yukeru one life

00:23:21.690 --> 00:23:28.450
Chigusa Tsukikage is waiting for Maya Kitajima and
Ayumi Himekawa in Ichiren Ozaki's hometown,

00:23:28.450 --> 00:23:32.340
Koubai Village, where a statue of an angel
stands, carved from a plum tree.

00:23:32.340 --> 00:23:37.250
Borrowing the legend of an angel who lives in a valley
filled with the blossoms of the scarlet plum,

00:23:37.250 --> 00:23:40.540
Ichiren gave Chigusa
the perfect role.

00:23:40.540 --> 00:23:43.250
The spirit of the plum tree, born after a thousand years...

00:23:43.250 --> 00:23:47.280
Chigusa, everyone in that audience
fell in love with you.

00:23:46.540 --> 00:23:51.500
Episode 46 - Into
the Valley of Plums

00:23:47.280 --> 00:23:50.930
A painful, unrequited love that
could never resolve itself.
